                                                "sense_id": "6b37f29d-0b31-307e-8b56-d12e875c2cb2",
                                                "text": "Not that one would realise that now, when looking at the quality of its restoration, and of the timber work, panelling, bargeboards, spandrels and cast-iron columns [...]."
